# Social colours

Use these colours for social media graphics and other promotional tiles, such as a post about a new civica release. They are not for the Home Assistant interface: for dashboards, use [Web colours](colour-web.html). Social colours do not change with the household's theme colour.

The social palette has every primary colour, tint, shade and accent, because social posts need more room for expression than a service. Keep the rest of the post consistent with the [Colour](colour.html) guidance.

